    "name": "Seated left knee up, holding the ankle",
    "description": "Sitting on the floor with the left knee raised high and the right leg stretched forward heel down, the left hand reaching toward the outside of the left ankle (resting on the lower shin, the closest the rig's arm reach allows) while the right hand rests on top of the raised knee. The torso turns slightly toward the raised leg. Left/right are the character's own.",
